top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=eaf90a1faac11711c4cf6eb3409d8d0c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3c30d134/uploads/origins/d4e93fc0-bd3d-4c83-8222-555e98be695d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6738975969cb2637c03f37360bd4d09a 3x"}, "body": "Thank you for your help.\nI am Thoughtful Rabin, who has drawn fan art for me several times before!\n\nThe picture I would like to request this time is an illustration that I have wished to have such a picture for a long time but gave up because it was difficult for me to draw the scenery by myself. I would like to make a request.\n\nHere is the image.\nThe background is an unpopular town with a nostalgic atmosphere\nRabin was squatting (he might be cute even if he was sitting on his haunches) and drawing a scribble of the universe with chalk on the ground, and was warned by a policeman on the spot.\nThe officer looks up at him with a foolish look on his face because he does not know common sense.\n\nSupplementary Explanation (Setting of Shikagura Rabin)\nShikaku Rabin comes from the future, but he is unable to return home because he cannot fix or operate his broken time machine. However, being a fool, he takes this matter lightly and lives happily in the present day, thinking that he can't go back. That's why he doesn't know much about common sense.\n\nI am sorry for specifying the details.\nThis is not a request for a picture to be used for something, but something that I genuinely want, but I may use it in the future for advertising.\n\nThis time, I would like to emphasize the atmosphere in the picture and the gentle and lonely atmosphere of the scenery that Ontake-san draws, rather than the cuteness of the character.\nI would be happy if you could draw Shikaku Rabin with his backside (while keeping the feeling that he is Shikaku Rabin), or draw the person close-up, or draw him wide as if he is pointing a camera at you from a distance, or any other composition that you think would be nice. It is also OK to change the content slightly!\n\nIf the content is too difficult, you can return it to ......!\nI would like to make another request with a different content at that time.", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hc_feee/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3250390, "client_id": 2506691, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/42d6fcfb/uploads/origins/ee07358e-985a-4dd8-84b2-3a7b4f01dbff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52958af58b044ee91690af665b2d1c34", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/42d6fcfb/uploads/origins/ee07358e-985a-4dd8-84b2-3a7b4f01dbff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52958af58b044ee91690af665b2d1c34, https://si.imgix.net/42d6fcfb/uploads/origins/ee07358e-985a-4dd8-84b2-3a7b4f01dbff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3e216ab4f07871cab8419426895be819 2x, https://si.imgix.net/42d6fcfb/uploads/origins/ee07358e-985a-4dd8-84b2-3a7b4f01dbff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8a9da202962fefef48dd0bda8bc58c93 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/42d6fcfb/uploads/origins/ee07358e-985a-4dd8-84b2-3a7b4f01dbff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=321610bfa4071cb0caa3ae53452fbbb7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/42d6fcfb/uploads/origins/ee07358e-985a-4dd8-84b2-3a7b4f01dbff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=321610bfa4071cb0caa3ae53452fbbb7, https://si.imgix.net/42d6fcfb/uploads/origins/ee07358e-985a-4dd8-84b2-3a7b4f01dbff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0c5d134471422a0ac1afa3ea01cb7ced